  entry
    definition "(often followed by ‘of’) a large number or amount or extent"
    examples ("a batch of letters" "a deal of trouble" "a lot of money" "he made a mint on the stock market" "see the rest of the winners in our huge passel of photos" "it must have cost plenty" "a slew of journalists" "a wad of money")
